{"tool_name":"intelligent-imaging","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The linked webpage presents a collection of ImageJ macros for Intelligent Imaging (Feedback to microscope system for the secondary scan).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>An ImageJ macro able to control some microscopes (Micro-manager or Leica CAM controlled) to acquire high resolution images of only some structures (e.g. isolated cells) or events (e.g. mitosis) within a sample. The scan is sequenced as a primary (low resolution monitoring) scan and a secondary (high resolution, multi-dimensional) scan.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The linked webpage presents a collection of ImageJ macros for Intelligent Imaging (Feedback to microscope system for the secondary scan).&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>An ImageJ macro able to control some microscopes (Micro-manager or Leica CAM controlled) to acquire high resolution images of only some structures (e.g. isolated cells) or events (e.g. mitosis) within a sample. The scan is sequenced as a primary (low resolution monitoring) scan and a secondary (high resolution, multi-dimensional) scan.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-28T15:23:47+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T14:30:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4691,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"842dd107-b22b-4cfd-b02b-2b47f0dd3afe","url":"/taxonomy/term/4691"},{"target_id":4692,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"c5e0f61a-c57d-490c-af13-7ef75dd23555","url":"/taxonomy/term/4692"},{"target_id":4693,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"3fe983b6-3da2-4baa-8d78-efcad66379ea","url":"/taxonomy/term/4693"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505205400,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"S\u00e9bastie